# T_SCRE: a location added inside the selected one, its type chosen from
# the pick list, which opens on the type the form chose, then put at the
# top level by clearing Inside, whose path line says so as the cursor
# leaves it for the code (the path is no stop); a duplicate code refused
# (the cursor on the code); deleting a location that holds locations
# refused after the question.
K INS
S NEWLOC
T Front hall
K TAB F4
S TYPES
K DOWN ENTER TAB CTRL-Y TAB
S TOPLEVEL
T HALL
K TAB
T 3
K CTRL-S
S LOCADDED
K INS
T Spare
K TAB
T BOX
K TAB TAB
T A1
K CTRL-S
S LOCDUP
K ESC
T Y
K HOME DEL
S DELQ
T Y
S OCCUPIED
K ESC
